# D56 state/derive/watch, D56 exclusions, D103 routing, D110 drag and drop, await.
state clicks is 0
derive doubled is clicks times 2
when clicks changes
    say "clicks is now" clicks doubled
.
clicks is clicks plus 1

homePage is a page
    title is "Home"
.
userPage is a page
    title is "User"
.
route "/" shows homePage
route "/users/:id" shows userPage
route otherwise shows homePage
go to "/users/7"
go back
go forward
replace route with "/"
on route change
    say current route
    say route parameter "id"
    say query parameter "q"
.

board is panel with accepts drops is true, width 300
tile is panel with draggable is true
put tile, board in homePage
on drag of tile
    set drag data to "tile-1"
.
on drop on board
    say drag data drop x drop y
    say dragged item
.
on files dropped on board
    for each f in dropped files
        say name of f
    .
.

to fetchLater
    await delay 250
    value is await delay 10
.
await fetchLater make result
await fetchLater into other

memo cached
    say "x"
.
shared theme is "dark"
on start
    say "start"
.
on close
    say "close"
.
focus tile
hide tile
